{"seq":3,"slug":"instruction-scheduling","title":"指令调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-optimization-codegen/codegen/instruction-scheduling","wordCount":1548,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"指令调度\">指令调度</h1><p>现代 CPU 不是一条指令算完再算下一条的简单机器，它是流水线化、超标量、乱序执行的：一条访存指令要等几十个周期才拿到数据，一条浮点乘法要好几个周期才出结果，而处理器每个周期能发射好几条指令。如果指令排列让后一条指令死等前一条的结果，流水线就会空转停顿。指令调度（Instruction Scheduling）就是在不违反数据依赖的前提下重排指令顺序，把这些延迟用别的有用工作填满，让硬件吃饱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>调度的依据是依赖关系，调度的目标是最小化停顿。下表区分需要尊重的几类依赖与几种调度范围。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>能否通过重命名消除</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>真依赖 RAW</td>\n<td>后者读前者写的值</td>\n<td>否（必须保序）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反依赖 WAR</td>\n<td>后者写前者读的位置</td>\n<td>能（换寄存器）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出依赖 WAW</td>\n<td>两者写同一位置</td>\n<td>能（换寄存器）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围: 局部调度</td>\n<td>单个基本块内</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围: 全局调度</td>\n<td>跨基本块</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围: 软件流水</td>\n<td>循环跨迭代重叠</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;待调度的基本块指令&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;构造依赖图 DAG&lt;br/&gt;节点=指令, 边=依赖+延迟&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;计算优先级&lt;br/&gt;(关键路径长度等)&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;表调度: 按周期发射就绪指令&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E{&quot;还有未调度指令?&quot;}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| D&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F[&quot;输出重排后的指令序列&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"待调度的基本块指令\"] --&gt; B[\"构造依赖图 DAG&lt;br/&gt;节点=指令, 边=依赖+延迟\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"计算优先级&lt;br/&gt;(关键路径长度等)\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"表调度: 按周期发射就绪指令\"]\n  D --&gt; E{\"还有未调度指令?\"}\n  E --&gt;|是| D\n  E --&gt;|否| F[\"输出重排后的指令序列\"]</pre><h2 id=\"依赖图与流水线停顿\">依赖图与流水线停顿</h2><p>调度的第一步是构造依赖图：节点是指令，有向边表示「这条指令必须排在那条之后」，边上还标注延迟（前者结果要等几个周期才可用）。真依赖（RAW，读后于写）是不可违反的——后者真的需要前者算出的值。反依赖（WAR）和输出依赖（WAW）则是「假」依赖，它们源于复用了同一个寄存器名，可以通过寄存器重命名消除，这也是乱序处理器硬件做的事，但编译期调度同样要么尊重、要么靠<a href=\"register-allocation\">寄存器分配</a>前的充足虚拟寄存器规避。</p>\n<p>停顿的根源是延迟。设一条加载指令延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 周期，如果紧随其后的指令立刻要用加载结果，处理器就得空等 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个周期。调度的使命就是把这 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个周期填上与加载无依赖的其它指令，让等待「免费」发生。</p>\n<h2 id=\"表调度\">表调度</h2><p>局部调度（单基本块内）最常用的算法是表调度（list scheduling）。它在依赖图上做一种带优先级的拓扑排序：维护一个「就绪集合」——所有前驱都已调度完、现在可以发射的指令；每个周期从就绪集合里按优先级挑出能发射的指令发射出去，被发射指令的后继在其延迟满足后进入就绪集合。</p>\n<p>优先级的核心启发式是关键路径长度：到出口的最长延迟路径越长的指令越优先，因为它最可能成为瓶颈。表调度是贪心的、不保证全局最优（最优调度是 NP 难的），但工程上效果好、速度快，是绝大多数编译器的局部调度主力。它要同时兼顾两个目标：填满延迟槽，以及不要因为过度并行展开而把寄存器压力推高到引发<a href=\"register-allocation\">寄存器分配</a>溢出——这正是调度与分配相位耦合的体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"软件流水\">软件流水</h2><p>循环是调度收益最高的地方，因为循环体会反复执行，任何延迟都被放大。软件流水（software pipelining）是专为循环设计的高级调度：它不再把每次迭代孤立调度，而是让不同迭代的指令重叠执行——当第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 次迭代的访存还在等待时，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 次迭代的计算已经开始。</p>\n<p>最经典的算法是模调度（modulo scheduling）。它寻找一个「启动间隔」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">II</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>（initiation interval）——相邻两次迭代启动之间的周期数——并构造一个稳态的内核（kernel），使每隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">II</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 个周期就能启动一次新迭代。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">II</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 的下界由两个约束决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mtext>资源需求</mtext><mtext>资源数</mtext></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mtext>依赖环延迟</mtext><mtext>环距离</mtext></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">II \\ge \\max\\left( \\left\\lceil \\frac{\\text{资源需求}}{\\text{资源数}} \\right\\rceil,\\ \\left\\lceil \\frac{\\text{依赖环延迟}}{\\text{环距离}} \\right\\rceil \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">资源数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">资源需求</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">环距离</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">依赖环延迟</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>前者是资源约束（功能单元不够用），后者是依赖约束（循环携带依赖形成的环）。软件流水还需生成进入稳态前的「填充」(prologue)和退出时的「排空」(epilogue)代码。它与<a href=\"../optimizations/loop-optimizations\">循环展开</a>是互补的两种暴露循环并行的手段，也常与<a href=\"../advanced/autovectorization\">自动向量化</a>配合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;迭代1: load&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;迭代1: compute&quot;]&#10;  C[&quot;迭代2: load (与上重叠)&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;迭代2: compute&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;迭代1: store&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;迭代2: store&quot;]&#10;  A -.稳态内核每 II 周期启动一次.-&gt; C\">graph TD\n  A[\"迭代1: load\"] --&gt; B[\"迭代1: compute\"]\n  C[\"迭代2: load (与上重叠)\"] --&gt; D[\"迭代2: compute\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"迭代1: store\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"迭代2: store\"]\n  A -.稳态内核每 II 周期启动一次.-&gt; C</pre><h2 id=\"与超标量乱序硬件的关系\">与超标量乱序硬件的关系</h2><p>也许有人会问：既然现代 CPU 自己就乱序执行、自己重命名寄存器，编译期调度还有意义吗？答案是仍然非常有意义。硬件的乱序窗口（重排序缓冲区）只有几十到几百条指令深，看不远；而延迟很长的访存若被排在依赖它的指令紧前面，硬件的有限窗口可能根本来不及找到足够的独立工作填补，依旧停顿。编译期调度从全局视角重排，把独立工作摊开，等于替硬件「预先消化」了一部分调度负担。对没有乱序能力的简单核（很多嵌入式、DSP、GPU 的执行单元）和 VLIW 架构，编译期调度更是性能的唯一来源——VLIW 把「哪些指令并行发射」的决定权完全交给了编译器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>指令调度在不违反依赖的前提下重排指令，用独立工作填满流水线延迟，避免停顿。</li>\n<li>依赖分真依赖（RAW，必须保序）与假依赖（WAR/WAW，可靠重命名消除），调度在依赖图上进行。</li>\n<li>表调度用关键路径优先的贪心拓扑排序做局部调度，兼顾填延迟与控制寄存器压力。</li>\n<li>软件流水（模调度）让不同迭代重叠执行，启动间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">II</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 由资源与依赖环双重约束，需生成 prologue/epilogue。</li>\n<li>软件流水与<a href=\"../optimizations/loop-optimizations\">循环展开</a>互补暴露循环并行，并与<a href=\"../advanced/autovectorization\">自动向量化</a>配合。</li>\n<li>编译期调度与<a href=\"register-allocation\">寄存器分配</a>相位耦合；即便面对乱序超标量硬件，全局调度对窗口有限的硬件与 VLIW/DSP 仍不可或缺。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"指令调度","id":"指令调度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖图与流水线停顿","id":"依赖图与流水线停顿"},{"level":2,"text":"表调度","id":"表调度"},{"level":2,"text":"软件流水","id":"软件流水"},{"level":2,"text":"与超标量乱序硬件的关系","id":"与超标量乱序硬件的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"寄存器分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-optimization-codegen/codegen/register-allocation"},"next":{"title":"过程间与链接时优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-optimization-codegen/advanced/interprocedural-lto"}}